; THE THREE BINS. Identical instances of SortBin.tscn; the only thing that distinguishes them is
; the NODE NAME, which is where the slot comes from (SortBin.SlotFromName). Slot 0 asks for RED on
; an odd round and CUBE on an even one, and the boxes never move -- re-labelling rather than
; re-arranging is what makes the second round of a match hard in the right way.
;
; Identity basis: the plate, the label and the icons already carry their own 180 degree yaw inside
; SortBin.tscn so they read from -Z, which is the side of the wall the room is on.

[node name="SortBin_0" parent="." instance=ExtResource("11_bin")]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1.2, 0, 4.6)

[node name="SortBin_1" parent="." instance=ExtResource("11_bin")]
