; ONE POLL FOR THE WHOLE JOB. SortRoom walks this room for its bins and its SortItems, steps the
; engine-free SortTally, and registers itself with HideSeekDriver as the IRoundFactSource that
; answers SortsCompleted. It is a plain Node: it needs no transform, it builds nothing, and every
; peer runs one (only the server answer is folded into the wire -- see SortRoom class doc).

[node name="SortRoom" type="Node" parent="."]
script = ExtResource("14_sortroom")
